{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】科大校長葉玉如及醫學院創院院長李競存今日(10月28日)將介紹籌建醫學院最新發展。同日，消委會主辦的消費權益新聞報道獎舉行頒獎禮，表彰傳媒發掘及報道關乎消費者權益的新聞。</p><p>採訪日誌｜科大介紹籌建醫學院最新發展／消費權益新聞報道獎頒獎禮</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T23:40:36.261441+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":125,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T23:30:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T23:58:32.840688+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T23:38:26.003793+00:00","content_hash":"f9fecb10691f39bc5f9afc977ce3581abbfecc86da7cb132edf7ae8e19cbc6be","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}